# Chess Mate-in-1 Practice App

Here's a complete chess endgame practice app with 3 mate-in-1 scenarios, drag-and-drop functionality, and visual feedback:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Chess Mate-in-1 Practice</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 100%);
            color: #fff;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 600px;
        }

        h1 {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        .subtitle {
            color: #a0aec0;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        .controls {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .scenario-buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .scenario-btn {
            padding: 12px 20px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            border: 2px solid transparent;
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            background: #4a5568;
            color: white;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .scenario-btn:hover {
            background: #718096;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .scenario-btn.active {
            background: #48bb78;
            border-color: #68d391;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(72, 187, 120, 0.4);
        }

        .reset-btn {
            padding: 12px 35px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e53e3e, #c53030);
            color: white;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            font-weight: 600;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(229, 62, 62, 0.3);
        }

        .reset-btn:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fc8181, #e53e3e);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .board-container {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 15px;
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #2d3748, #1a202c);
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }

        .board-wrapper {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .rank-labels {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            margin-right: 5px;
        }

        .rank-label {
            height: 65px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #a0aec0;
            width: 20px;
        }

        .board-with-files {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .file-labels {
            display: flex;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }

        .file-label {
            width: 65px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #a0aec0;
        }

        .board {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(8, 65px);
            grid-template-rows: repeat(8, 65px);
            border: 3px solid #4a5568;
            border-radius: 4px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .square {
            width: 65px;
            height: 65px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            font-size: 50px;
            position: relative;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .square.light {
            background: #f0d9b5;
        }

        .square.dark {
            background: #b58863;
        }

        .square.highlight {
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 4px rgba(255, 255, 0, 0.8);
        }

        .square.drag-over {
            background: rgba(100, 200, 100, 0.5) !important;
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 20px rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.3);
        }

        .piece {
            cursor: grab;
            user-select: none;
            transition: transform 0.15s ease;
            line-height: 1;
            filter: drop-shadow(2px 2px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.3));
        }

        .piece:hover {
            transform: scale(1.1);
        }

        .piece.dragging {
            opacity: 0.4;
            cursor: grabbing;
        }

        .piece.not-draggable {
            cursor: default;
        }

        .feedback {
            margin-top: 25px;
            padding: 18px 35px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            transition: all 0.4s ease;
        }

        .feedback.show {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        .feedback.correct {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #48bb78, #38a169);
            color: white;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(72, 187, 120, 0.4);
        }

        .feedback.incorrect {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e53e3e, #c53030);
            color: white;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(229, 62, 62, 0.4);
        }

        .info {
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding: 15px 25px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: #e2e8f0;
            background: rgba(74, 85, 104, 0.5);
            border-radius: 8px;
            border-left: 4px solid #48bb78;
        }

        .turn-indicator {
            margin-top: 15px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: #ffd700;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        @keyframes correctPulse {
            0%, 100% { box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 4px rgba(72, 187, 120, 0.8); }
            50% { box-shadow: inset 0 0 30px rgba(72, 187, 120, 0.6); }
        }

        @keyframes incorrectShake {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateX(0); }
            25% { transform: translateX(-5px); }
            75% { transform: translateX(5px); }
        }

        .square.correct-animation {
            animation: correctPulse 0.6s ease 3;
            background: rgba(72, 187, 120, 0.5) !important;
        }

        .square.incorrect-animation {
            animation: incorrectShake 0.3s ease 2;
        }

        .scenario-title {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            color: #ffd700;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>♚ Mate in 1 Practice</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Find the winning move for White!</p>

        <div class="controls">
            <div class="scenario-buttons">
                <button class="scenario-btn active" onclick="loadScenario(0)">
                    📍 Back Rank Mate
                </button>
                <button class="scenario-btn" onclick="loadScenario(1)">
                    👑 Queen & King
                </button>
                <button class="scenario-btn" onclick="loadScenario(2)">
                    🏰 Corner Trap
                </button>
            </div>
            <button class="reset-btn" onclick="resetPosition()">🔄 Reset Position</button>
        </div>

        <div class="scenario-title" id="scenario-title">Back Rank Mate</div>

        <div class="board-container">
            <div class="board-wrapper">
                <div class="rank-labels">
                    <div class="rank-label">8</div>
                    <div class="rank-label">7</div>
                    <div class="rank-label">6</div>
                    <div class="rank-label">5</div>
                    <div class="rank-label">4</div>
                    <div class="rank-label">3</div>
                    <div class="rank-label">2</div>
                    <div class="rank-label">1</div>
                </div>
                <div class="board-with-files">
                    <div class="board" id="board"></div>
                    <div class="file-labels">
                        <div class="file-label">a</div>
                        <div class="file-label">b</div>
                        <div class="file-label">c</div>
                        <div class="file-label">d</div>
                        <div class="file-label">e</div>
                        <div class="file-label">f</div>
                        <div class="file-label">g</div>
                        <div class="file-label">h</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="turn-indicator" id="turn-indicator">⚪ White to move - Find checkmate!</div>

        <div class="feedback" id="feedback"></div>

        <div class="info" id="scenario-info">
            The black king is trapped behind its own pawns. Deliver the final blow!
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        // Chess piece Unicode symbols
        const PIECES = {
            'K': '♔', 'Q': '♕', 'R': '♖', 'B': '♗', 'N': '♘', 'P': '♙',
            'k': '♚', 'q': '♛', 'r': '♜', 'b': '♝', 'n': '♞', 'p': '♟'
        };

        // Three mate-in-1 scenarios
        const scenarios = [
            {
                name: "Back Rank Mate",
                description: "The black king is trapped behind its own pawns. Use the queen to deliver checkmate on the back rank!",
                position: {
                    'g1': 'K', 'd1': 'Q',
                    'g8': 'k', 'f7': 'p', 'g7': 'p', 'h7': 'p'
                },
                solution: { from: 'd1', to: 'd8' },
                hint: "Qd8#"
            },
            {
                name: "Queen & King Mate",
                description: "Your king supports the queen. Cut off all escape squares and deliver checkmate!",
                position: {
                    'g6': 'K', 'h3': 'Q',
                    'h8': 'k'
                },
                solution: { from: 'h3', to: 'h7' },
                hint: "Qh7#"
            },
            {
                name: "Corner Trap",
                description: "The enemy king is cornered! Your king blocks the escape routes. Finish the game!",
                position: {
                    'c7': 'K', 'a2': 'Q',
                    'a8': 'k'
                },
                solution: { from: 'a2', to: 'a7' },
                hint: "Qa7#"
            }
        ];

        let currentScenario = 0;
        let currentPosition = {};
        let draggedPiece = null;
        let solved = false;

        // Convert coordinates to square notation (e.g., "e4")
        function coordsToSquare(file, rank) {
            return String.fromCharCode('a'.charCodeAt(0) + file) + (rank + 1);
        }

        // Create the chess board
        function createBoard() {
            const board = document.getElementById('board');
            board.innerHTML = '';

            for (let rank = 7; rank >= 0; rank--) {
                for (let file = 0; file < 8; file++) {
                    const square = document.createElement('div');
                    const squareName = coordsToSquare(file, rank);
                    const isLight = (file + rank) % 2 === 1;

                    square.className = `square ${isLight ? 'light' : 'dark'}`;
                    square.dataset.square = squareName;

                    // Drag and drop event listeners
                    square.addEventListener('dragover', handleDragOver);
                    square.addEventListener('drop', handleDrop);
                    square.addEventListener('dragenter', handleDragEnter);
                    square.addEventListener('dragleave', handleDragLeave);

                    board.appendChild(square);
                }
            }
        }

        // Render pieces on the board
        function renderPosition() {
            // Clear all pieces first
            document.querySelectorAll('.square').forEach(square => {
                square.innerHTML = '';
            });

            // Place each piece
            for (const [squareName, piece] of Object.entries(currentPosition)) {
                const square = document.querySelector(`[data-square="${squareName}"]`);
                if (square) {
                    const pieceElement = document.createElement('span');
                    pieceElement.className = 'piece';
                    pieceElement.textContent = PIECES[piece];
                    pieceElement.dataset.piece = piece;
                    pieceElement.dataset.square = squareName;

                    // Only white pieces (uppercase) are draggable when not solved
                    const isWhitePiece = piece === piece.toUpperCase();
                    if (isWhitePiece && !solved) {
                        pieceElement.draggable = true;
                        pieceElement.addEventListener('dragstart', handleDragStart);
                        pieceElement.addEventListener('dragend', handleDragEnd);
                    } else {
                        pieceElement.classList.add('not-draggable');
                    }

                    square.appendChild(pieceElement);
                }
            }
        }

        // Load a specific scenario
        function loadScenario(index) {
            currentScenario = index;
            currentPosition = { ...scenarios[index].position };
            solved = false;

            // Update button active states
            document.querySelectorAll('.scenario-btn').forEach((btn, i) => {
                btn.classList.toggle('active', i === index);
            });

            // Update scenario title and info
            document.getElementById('scenario-title').textContent = scenarios[index].name;
            document.getElementById('scenario-info').textContent = scenarios[index].description;
            document.getElementById('turn-indicator').textContent = '⚪ White to move - Find checkmate!';
            document.getElementById('turn-indicator').style.color = '#ffd700';

            // Hide feedback
            const feedback = document.getElementById('feedback');
            feedback.classList.remove('show', 'correct', 'incorrect');

            // Clear any animations
            document.querySelectorAll('.square').forEach(sq => {
                sq.classList.remove('correct-animation', 'incorrect-animation', 'highlight', 'drag-over');
            });

            renderPosition();
        }

        // Reset to initial position
        function resetPosition() {
            loadScenario(currentScenario);
        }

        // Drag start handler
        function handleDragStart(e) {
            if (solved) {
                e.preventDefault();
                return;
            }

            draggedPiece = {
                piece: e.target.dataset.piece,
                from: e.target.dataset.square
            };

            e.target.classList.add('dragging');
            e.dataTransfer.effectAllowed = 'move';
            e.dataTransfer.setData('text/plain', ''); // Required for Firefox

            // Highlight source square
            const sourceSquare = document.querySelector(`[data-square="${draggedPiece.from}"]`);
            if (sourceSquare) {
                sourceSquare.classList.add('highlight');
            }
        }

        // Drag end handler
        function handleDragEnd(e) {
            e.target.classList.remove('dragging');

            // Remove all highlights
            document.querySelectorAll('.square').forEach(sq => {
                sq.classList.remove('highlight', 'drag-over');
            });

            draggedPiece = null;
        }

        // Drag over handler
        function handleDragOver(e) {
            e.preventDefault();
            e.dataTransfer.dropEffect = 'move';
        }

        // Drag enter handler
        function handleDragEnter(e) {
            e.preventDefault();
            if (draggedPiece) {
                const square = e.target.closest('.square');
                if (square && square.dataset.square !== draggedPiece.from) {
                    square.classList.add('drag-over');
                }
            }
        }

        // Drag leave handler
        function handleDragLeave(e) {
            const square = e.target.closest('.square');
            if (square) {
                square.classList.remove('drag-over');
            }
        }

        // Drop handler - main game logic
        function handleDrop(e) {
            e.preventDefault();

            if (solved || !draggedPiece) return;

            const targetSquare = e.target.closest('.square');
            if (!targetSquare) return;

            const to = targetSquare.dataset.square;
            const from = draggedPiece.from;

            // Don't allow dropping on same square
            if (from === to) return;

            // Remove visual highlights
            document.querySelectorAll('.square').forEach(sq => {
                sq.classList.remove('highlight', 'drag-over');
            });

            // Check if this move is the correct solution
            const solution = scenarios[currentScenario].solution;
            const isCorrect = from === solution.from && to === solution.to;

            if (isCorrect) {
                // Execute the winning move
                delete currentPosition[from];
                currentPosition[to] = draggedPiece.piece;
                renderPosition();

                // Visual success feedback
                showFeedback(true);
                targetSquare.classList.add('correct-animation');

                // Update turn indicator
                document.getElementById('turn-indicator').textContent = '🏆 Checkmate! White wins!';
                document.getElementById('turn-indicator').style.color = '#48bb78';

                solved = true;
            } else {
                // Visual error feedback
                showFeedback(false);
                targetSquare.classList.add('incorrect-animation');

                setTimeout(() => {
                    targetSquare.classList.remove('incorrect-animation');
                }, 600);
            }

            draggedPiece = null;
        }

        // Display feedback message
        function showFeedback(isCorrect) {
            const feedback = document.getElementById('feedback');
            const scenario = scenarios[currentScenario];

            if (isCorrect) {
                feedback.innerHTML = `🎉 Checkmate! <strong>${scenario.hint}</strong> - Excellent!`;
                feedback.className = 'feedback show correct';
            } else {
                feedback.innerHTML = '❌ That\'s not checkmate. Try again!';
                feedback.className = 'feedback show incorrect';

                // Hide error message after delay
                setTimeout(() => {
                    feedback.classList.remove('show');
                }, 2500);
            }
        }

        // Initialize the app
        function init() {
            createBoard();
            loadScenario(0);
        }

        // Start the app when page loads
        init();
    </script>
</body>
</html>
```

## Features Included:

### 🎯 **Three Mate-in-1 Scenarios:**
1. **Back Rank Mate** - Classic pattern where the queen delivers mate on the 8th rank (Qd8#)
2. **Queen & King Mate** - King supports queen for the final blow (Qh7#)
3. **Corner Trap** - Enemy king trapped in the corner (Qa7#)

### 🎮 **Functionality:**
- **Drag & Drop** - Drag white pieces to make moves
- **Scenario Selection** - Click buttons to switch between puzzles
- **Reset Button** - Restore the current position
- **Visual Feedback**:
  - Green animation + success message for correct moves
  - Red shake animation + error message for wrong moves
  - Square highlighting during drag operations

### 🎨 **Visual Elements:**
- Clean, modern dark theme
- Board coordinates (a-h, 1-8)
- Piece shadows and hover effects
- Animated feedback for moves
- Turn indicator that updates on completion

### 📱 **How to Use:**
1. Select a scenario using the top buttons
2. Drag a white piece to deliver checkmate
3. Get instant feedback on your move
4. Use Reset to try again or switch scenarios
